msgid "=== \"Prebuilt image\""
msgstr "=== \"预构建镜像\""

msgid ""
"#### Use a prebuilt vLLM Ascend image {: #installation-prebuilt-image }"
msgstr "#### 使用预构建的 vLLM Ascend 镜像 {: #installation-prebuilt-image }"

msgid ""
"The host needs only a working Ascend driver and firmware, plus Docker. The "
"image includes the CANN user-space environment, PyTorch/TorchNPU, vLLM, and "
"vLLM Ascend."
msgstr ""
"主机只需具备可用的 Ascend 驱动和固件，以及 Docker。镜像包含 CANN 用户空间环境、PyTorch/TorchNPU、vLLM 和 "
"vLLM Ascend。"

msgid "##### Select an image {: #installation-prebuilt-image-selection }"
msgstr "##### 选择镜像 {: #installation-prebuilt-image-selection }"

msgid "| Hardware | Ubuntu | openEuler |"
msgstr "| 硬件 | Ubuntu | openEuler |"

msgid ""
"    | Ascend A2 series products | `quay.io/ascend/vllm-ascend:{{ "
"vllm_ascend_version }}` | `quay.io/ascend/vllm-ascend:{{ vllm_ascend_version"
" }}-openeuler` |"
msgstr ""
"    | Ascend A2 系列产品 | `quay.io/ascend/vllm-ascend:{{ vllm_ascend_version "
"}}` | `quay.io/ascend/vllm-ascend:{{ vllm_ascend_version }}-openeuler` |"

msgid ""
"    | Ascend A3 series products | `quay.io/ascend/vllm-ascend:{{ "
"vllm_ascend_version }}-a3` | `quay.io/ascend/vllm-ascend:{{ "
"vllm_ascend_version }}-a3-openeuler` |"
msgstr ""
"    | Ascend A3 系列产品 | `quay.io/ascend/vllm-ascend:{{ vllm_ascend_version "
"}}-a3` | `quay.io/ascend/vllm-ascend:{{ vllm_ascend_version }}-a3-openeuler`"
" |"

msgid ""
"    | Ascend 310P series products | `quay.io/ascend/vllm-ascend:{{ "
"vllm_ascend_version }}-310p` | `quay.io/ascend/vllm-ascend:{{ "
"vllm_ascend_version }}-310p-openeuler` |"
msgstr ""
"    | Ascend 310P 系列产品 | `quay.io/ascend/vllm-ascend:{{ vllm_ascend_version "
"}}-310p` | `quay.io/ascend/vllm-ascend:{{ vllm_ascend_version "
"}}-310p-openeuler` |"

msgid ""
"    | Ascend 950DT series products | `quay.io/ascend/vllm-ascend:{{ "
"vllm_ascend_version }}-950dt` | `quay.io/ascend/vllm-ascend:{{ "
"vllm_ascend_version }}-950dt-openeuler` |"
msgstr ""
"    | Ascend 950DT 系列产品 | `quay.io/ascend/vllm-ascend:{{ vllm_ascend_version"
" }}-950dt` | `quay.io/ascend/vllm-ascend:{{ vllm_ascend_version }}-950dt-"
"openeuler` |"

msgid ""
"##### Pull and inspect the image {: #installation-prebuilt-image-pull }"
msgstr "##### 拉取并检查镜像 {: #installation-prebuilt-image-pull }"

msgid "??? tip \"Build an image from a Dockerfile\""
msgstr "??? tip \"从 Dockerfile 构建镜像\""

msgid ""
"The default `Dockerfile` targets A2. For other hardware, use the "
"corresponding Dockerfile in the repository, such as the A3, 310P, or 950DT "
"Dockerfile."
msgstr ""
"默认的 `Dockerfile` 面向 A2。对于其他硬件，请使用仓库中对应的 Dockerfile，例如 A3、310P 或 950DT 的 "
"Dockerfile。"
